WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:01:16.042 --> 00:01:18.260
My name is Alick and his is Tengere.

00:01:19.338 --> 00:01:23.027
I am Kazakh and in this country, I am called the father of birds.

00:01:47.727 --> 00:01:49.852
Tengere has lived with me for ten years.

00:01:50.712 --> 00:01:51.632
I found it here.

00:01:52.093 --> 00:01:53.001
in these mountains,

00:01:53.751 --> 00:01:55.703
between China and the Russian Empire.

00:01:57.343 --> 00:01:58.578
It was a winter morning.

00:01:59.516 --> 00:02:02.359
Tengere's wings were trapped in the ice.

00:02:02.609 --> 00:02:03.641
They could no longer fly.

00:02:05.109 --> 00:02:06.126
I brought it home.

00:02:06.819 --> 00:02:09.322
I got him used to my presence and over time,

00:02:09.582 --> 00:02:10.663
He became my friend.

00:02:20.813 --> 00:02:22.353
I've had other eagles before him.

00:02:23.094 --> 00:02:24.141
My father had some too.

00:02:24.860 --> 00:02:26.032
And my father's father.

00:02:27.204 --> 00:02:27.954
They lived, like me,

00:02:28.454 --> 00:02:30.610
by hunting and selling pots.

00:02:31.844 --> 00:02:34.360
They taught me to read in the flight of birds.

00:02:49.463 --> 00:02:50.384
For centuries,

00:02:50.405 --> 00:02:57.252
The Kazakhs ruled over Central Asia.

00:02:58.473 --> 00:03:00.176
With wars and invasions,

00:03:00.435 --> 00:03:03.856
We have lost our land and some of our knowledge.

00:03:35.888 --> 00:03:36.247
what time

00:03:36.247 --> 00:03:36.888
what time

00:03:36.889 --> 00:03:42.449
what time

00:03:46.778 --> 00:03:47.622
In a few days,

00:03:47.653 --> 00:03:48.716
Tengere will leave me.

00:03:49.356 --> 00:03:50.778
He will regain his freedom.

00:03:53.169 --> 00:03:54.449
He must go back up there.

00:03:54.888 --> 00:03:55.560
near his family.

00:03:56.300 --> 00:03:58.763
To find a partner and have children.

00:04:02.626 --> 00:04:03.747
Before they leave,

00:04:03.786 --> 00:04:07.407
I want them to help me pass on to my son the ancient wisdom of the Kazakhs.

00:04:08.313 --> 00:04:11.836
life with the big birds and winters in the mountains.

00:04:34.857 --> 00:04:37.857
My son Oulam is now old enough to carry an eagle,

00:04:38.052 --> 00:04:41.137
And my role was to teach him the secrets of our family.

00:04:42.637 --> 00:04:43.201
And for that,

00:04:43.295 --> 00:04:44.920
I must capture another eagle,

00:04:45.372 --> 00:04:46.482
and when it is erected,

00:04:47.232 --> 00:04:48.216
I will bring my son.

00:04:49.591 --> 00:04:51.935
I will show him the lands of our ancestors.

00:04:52.720 --> 00:04:55.333
The Land of the Wind and the Kingdom of the Eagles.

00:05:07.505 --> 00:05:09.769
Around a hundred eagles live in this territory.

00:05:10.487 --> 00:05:11.331
But they are wary.

00:05:11.750 --> 00:05:13.112
They know the Russians like men.

00:05:13.995 --> 00:05:15.315
He must be two years old.

00:05:16.894 --> 00:05:17.714
Go to Tengere,

00:05:18.096 --> 00:05:19.839
Help me trap him.

00:07:13.706 --> 00:07:15.389
The eagle is a proud bird.

00:07:15.750 --> 00:07:17.788
He goes crazy when he gets caught in the trap.

00:07:18.569 --> 00:07:21.233
Grief, on the other hand, burns inside the body.

00:07:22.358 --> 00:07:23.375
To extinguish this fire,

00:07:23.555 --> 00:07:26.156
I need to pour cold water down the back of his throat.

00:07:26.781 --> 00:07:27.281
Without that,

00:07:27.281 --> 00:07:28.125
He could die.

00:07:42.031 --> 00:07:43.274
My name is Riketan,

00:07:43.776 --> 00:07:45.720
like this mountain where I captured it.

00:08:14.394 --> 00:08:16.557
I don't like the first few days of training.

00:08:17.538 --> 00:08:18.158
Greg is upset.

00:08:18.517 --> 00:08:19.362
He is afraid of the man.

00:08:19.682 --> 00:08:20.478
He doesn't understand.

00:08:21.541 --> 00:08:26.283
I have to tire him out to the very end of his strength so that he will accept me and forget his pain.

00:08:37.751 --> 00:08:39.533
I spend little time with my family.

00:08:44.511 --> 00:08:45.274
I love them,

00:08:45.312 --> 00:08:46.075
but on the farm,

00:08:46.114 --> 00:08:47.696
The Eagles are too dangerous.

00:08:48.418 --> 00:08:50.618
I don't want them to get used to the noise of men.

00:08:51.239 --> 00:08:53.761
I want them to remain pure and wild.

00:08:56.722 --> 00:08:57.222
THANKS.

00:09:11.674 --> 00:09:13.534
The initial training lasts a few days.

00:09:14.414 --> 00:09:16.793
I need to get Ketan used to hunting with me right away.

00:09:17.697 --> 00:09:19.414
He needs to understand that I am his friend.

00:09:19.953 --> 00:09:21.477
that I don't want to hide his prey from him,

00:09:21.658 --> 00:09:24.735
And above all, that we can and must work together.

00:09:54.937 --> 00:09:56.024
I reassure Ketan.

00:09:56.993 --> 00:10:01.399
I tell him that he is the most beautiful of birds and that he can eat by my side.

00:10:01.889 --> 00:10:02.510
Without fear,

00:10:04.052 --> 00:10:05.472
I never approach him from the front.

00:10:06.215 --> 00:10:07.894
The eagle does not like the face of man,

00:10:07.956 --> 00:10:09.195
He prefers his profile.

00:10:28.769 --> 00:10:31.711
Every one of my movements must be precise and controlled.

00:10:32.653 --> 00:10:33.934
I never get along with it.

00:10:34.875 --> 00:10:37.020
My son Ulan needs to learn all of this.

00:10:38.239 --> 00:10:38.903
It will be a long process.

00:10:39.918 --> 00:10:41.302
But Tengere will help him.

00:11:46.558 --> 00:11:49.386
"Ethan now agrees to sit on my arm."

00:11:50.403 --> 00:11:50.793
Tomorrow,

00:11:50.793 --> 00:11:52.371
He will be ready and we will leave.

00:12:07.315 --> 00:12:10.339
Ketan will come with me and Ulan will take Tengere.

00:12:11.562 --> 00:12:12.663
Leaving with my son,

00:12:12.717 --> 00:12:14.038
It's an old dream of mine.

00:12:14.562 --> 00:12:15.960
An old dream of Khasar's.

00:12:16.460 --> 00:12:18.107
He wants to maintain the traditions.

00:14:23.692 --> 00:14:24.457
In the mountains,

00:14:24.552 --> 00:14:26.817
Tengere and I have a language.

00:14:27.802 --> 00:14:29.192
I inherited it from my ancestors.

00:14:30.477 --> 00:14:32.118
Now,
it's my son's turn to take it.

00:14:48.599 --> 00:14:50.629
This
sound is that of dying prey.

00:14:51.519 --> 00:14:55.129
All of Tengere's power is concentrated in its talons.

00:14:55.644 --> 00:14:56.224
He is tense.

00:14:56.769 --> 00:14:57.660
ready to attack.

00:15:29.158 --> 00:15:31.235
I'm taking you to the land of our ancestors.

00:17:37.471 --> 00:17:38.049
The story

00:17:38.050 --> 00:17:39.674
of our people is very ancient.

00:17:40.644 --> 00:17:44.174
Our legends tell of our connection with the bird people.

00:17:45.237 --> 00:17:45.721
Formerly,

00:17:45.721 --> 00:17:48.330
The Kazars could tame them all.

00:17:49.112 --> 00:17:51.080
Some even knew their language.

00:17:52.113 --> 00:17:52.655
Today,

00:17:52.776 --> 00:17:54.020
We are now only a handful.

00:20:20.901 --> 00:20:21.448
Tengere

00:20:21.509 --> 00:20:23.009
and I are partners.

00:20:24.104 --> 00:20:25.259
They hunt,

00:20:25.260 --> 00:20:26.073
pots are selling,

00:20:26.901 --> 00:20:27.979
They eat meat.

00:20:30.337 --> 00:20:30.759
For us,

00:20:30.759 --> 00:20:31.401
the Kassas,

00:20:31.557 --> 00:20:32.462
the sacred Church.

00:20:33.564 --> 00:20:36.478
It is both the beauty and the harshness of the world.

00:21:48.634 --> 00:21:49.071
Here,

00:21:49.071 --> 00:21:51.400
Each eagle reigns over a territory.

00:21:51.983 --> 00:21:52.944
And they defend him.

00:21:53.746 --> 00:21:54.886
sometimes even to the point of death.

00:21:56.669 --> 00:21:57.169
Here,

00:21:57.230 --> 00:22:00.950
Many Kazakhs perished because they were defending their territory.

00:22:23.773 --> 00:22:24.654
Near an eagle,

00:22:24.715 --> 00:22:25.857
Life is wonderful.

00:22:26.798 --> 00:22:27.979
Like with a child.

00:22:29.323 --> 00:22:30.221
For the past ten years,

00:22:30.298 --> 00:22:31.862
I never left Tengere.

00:22:32.940 --> 00:22:33.565
I fed him,

00:22:33.987 --> 00:22:34.682
I took care of him.

00:22:35.307 --> 00:22:35.846
And now,

00:22:35.869 --> 00:22:36.588
He's going to leave.

00:22:51.972 --> 00:22:53.653
The season of love begins.

00:22:54.173 --> 00:22:55.614
Tengere will find a wife.

00:22:56.473 --> 00:22:59.673
He will have a son and he will tell him the stories of men.

00:23:58.492 --> 00:24:01.813
Tengere has to leave now, and that's fine.

00:24:18.730 --> 00:24:19.075
Go

00:24:19.075 --> 00:24:19.622
Tengere,

00:24:21.137 --> 00:24:22.183
Don't come back.

00:24:47.180 --> 00:24:48.162
One last thing,

00:24:50.086 --> 00:24:58.819
Remember that the eagle is the only creature that can look directly at the sun without burning its eyes.

